y+Logic%22%2C%22lengthSeconds%22%3A15%2C%22keywords%22%3A%5B%22Bank%22%2C%22Banking%22%2C%22Finance%22%2C%22Money%22%2C%22Money+101%22%2C%22Money+Hack%22%2C%22Money+Logic%22%2C%22Money+goals.%22%2C%22Savings%22%2C%22Spending%22%2C%22Stocks%22%2C%22Tips%22%2C%22Wells+Fargo%22%2C%22Wells+Fargo+YouTube%22%5D%2C%22channelId%22%3A%22UCGcBOP3IhbgHOPBcUFUZRdQ%22%2C%22isOwnerViewing%22%3Afalse%2C%22shortDescription%22%3A%22We+all+have+our+own+unique+money+logic.+With+a+Clear+Access+Banking+Account%2C+Leo+has+no+overdraft+fees+and+tools+to+track+spending.+However+you+make+money+work%2C+we+can+work+with+that.+%5CnLearn+more+at+https%3A%2F%2Fwelcome.wf.com%2Fmoneysmart%2F%3Ffocus%3Dstartsmart%5Cu0026utm_campaign%3D26_pcm_cons_uf_en%5Cu0026utm_source%3Dyoutube%5Cu0026utm_medium%3Dorganicvideo%5Cu0026utm_content%3Dleostartsmart15+%5Cn%5CnTranscript%3A+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BVideo+Overview%3A+Promotion+for+the+Wells+Fargo+Clear+Access+Banking+Account%2C+ideal+as+a+first+teen+or+student+bank+account%2C+or+second+chance+banking+opportunity.+This+video+features+a+young+boy%2C+Leo%2C+13-15+years+old%2C+in+a+convenience+store%2C+purchasing+2+drinks+and+2+family-sized+bags+of+chips%2C+while+his+mother+waits+in+the+car+outside.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BWe+open+on+Leo+in+a+convenience+store%2C+holding+two+drinks%2C+and+considering+purchasing+two-family+sized+%E2%80%98Buy-One-Get-One%27+bags+of+chips.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+disclosure%3A+%5Cn+%5CnThe+Wells+Fargo+Clear+Access+Banking+account+monthly+service+fee+is+%245.+Minimum+opening+deposit+is+%2425.+Other+limitations+apply%2C+see+the+Wells+Fargo+Consumer+Account+Fee+and+Information+Schedule+and+Deposit+Account+Agreement+for+details.%5D+%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+To+Leo%2C+Buy-One-Get-One+snacks+means+maximizing+his+savings+potential.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo+grabs+the+two+bags+of+chips.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo+walks+over+to+the+register+and+places+the+drinks+and+chips+on+the+counter.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo+taps+his+card+to+the+scanner+to+pay+the+%246.93+total+for+his+items.+Payment+is+approved.%5D+%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+However+you+make+money+work%2C+we+can+work+with+that.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo%E2%80%99s+mom+watches+Leo+exit+with+his+items+looking+unexpectedly+at+his+purchase.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BWells+Fargo+Sonic+Logo%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+Disclosure%3A+%5Cn+%5CnWells+Fargo+Bank%2C+N.A.+Member+FDIC.%5D%22%2C%22isCrawlable%22%3Atrue%2C%22thumbnail%22%3A%7B%22thumbnails%22%3A%5B%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2F-JbHToroqqM%2Fhqdefault.jpg%3Fsqp%3D-oaymwEiCKgBEF5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ%3D%3D%5Cu0026rs%3DAOn4CLBuPLSj6314TIeprcYfhM5SZpL4eg%22%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A94%7D%2C%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2F-JbHToroqqM%2Fhqdefault.jpg%3Fsqp%3D-oaymwEiCMQBEG5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ%3D%3D%5Cu0026rs%3DAOn4CLBqyEI9e4OSAqiXz6PaRmn4mdbhxw%22%2C%22width%22%3A196%2C%22height%22%3A110%7D%2C%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2F-JbHToroqqM%2Fhqdefault.jpg%3Fsqp%3D-oaymwEjCPYBEIoBSFryq4qpAxUIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAE%3D%5Cu0026rs%3DAOn4CLCwlMzKewJDiOLmzKpUs23GQ58bLg%22%2C%22width%22%3A246%2C%22height%22%3A138%7D%2C%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2F-JbHToroqqM%2Fhqdefault.jpg%3Fsqp%3D-oaymwEjCNACELwBSFryq4qpAxUIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAE%3D%5Cu0026rs%3DAOn4CLB5MrkPN5swzh6KqDfafNP6Aqy8Bg%22%2C%22width%22%3A336%2C%22height%22%3A188%7D%2C%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2F-JbHToroqqM%2Fmaxresdefault.jpg%22%2C%22width%22%3A1920%2C%22height%22%3A1080%7D%5D%7D%2C%22allowRatings%22%3Atrue%2C%22viewCount%22%3A%22108264621%22%2C%22author%22%3A%22Wells+Fargo%22%2C%22isPrivate%22%3Afalse%2C%22isUnpluggedCorpus%22%3Afalse%2C%22isLiveContent%22%3Afalse%2C%22isTvfilmVideo%22%3Afalse%7D%2C%22playerConfig%22%3A%7B%22granularVariableSpeedConfig%22%3A%7B%22minimumPlaybackRate%22%3A100%2C%22maximumPlaybackRate%22%3A100%7D%2C%22vssClientConfig%22%3A%7B%22vssUsePostRequest%22%3Atrue%7D%2C%22audioConfig%22%3A%7B%22loudnessDb%22%3A4.4700003%2C%22perceptualLoudnessDb%22%3A-