rganicvideo%5Cu0026utm_content%3Dleostartsmart15+%5Cn%5CnTranscript%3A+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BVideo+Overview%3A+Promotion+for+the+Wells+Fargo+Clear+Access+Banking+Account%2C+ideal+as+a+first+teen+or+student+bank+account%2C+or+second+chance+banking+opportunity.+This+video+features+a+young+boy%2C+Leo%2C+13-15+years+old%2C+in+a+convenience+store%2C+purchasing+2+drinks+and+2+family-sized+bags+of+chips%2C+while+his+mother+waits+in+the+car+outside.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BWe+open+on+Leo+in+a+convenience+store%2C+holding+two+drinks%2C+and+considering+purchasing+two-family+sized+%E2%80%98Buy-One-Get-One%27+bags+of+chips.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+disclosure%3A+%5Cn+%5CnThe+Wells+Fargo+Clear+Access+Banking+account+monthly+service+fee+is+%245.+Minimum+opening+deposit+is+%2425.+Other+limitations+apply%2C+see+the+Wells+Fargo+Consumer+Account+Fee+and+Information+Schedule+and+Deposit+Account+Agreement+for+details.%5D+%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+To+Leo%2C+Buy-One-Get-One+snacks+means+maximizing+his+savings+potential.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo+grabs+the+two+bags+of+chips.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo+walks+over+to+the+register+and+places+the+drinks+and+chips+on+the+counter.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo+taps+his+card+to+the+scanner+to+pay+the+%246.93+total+for+his+items.+Payment+is+approved.%5D+%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+However+you+make+money+work%2C+we+can+work+with+that.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo%E2%80%99s+mom+watches+Leo+exit+with+his+items+looking+unexpectedly+at+his+purchase.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BWells+Fargo+Sonic+Logo%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+Disclosure%3A+%5Cn+%5CnWells+Fargo+Bank%2C+N.A.+Member+FDIC.%5D%22%7D%2C%22lengthSeconds%22%3A16%2C%22ownerProfileUrl%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2F%40wellsfargo%22%2C%22externalChannelId%22%3A%22UCGcBOP3IhbgHOPBcUFUZRdQ%22%2C%22isFamilySafe%22%3Afalse%2C%22availableCountries%22%3A%5B%22AD%22%2C%22AE%22%2C%22AF%22%2C%22AG%22%2C%22AI%22%2C%22AL%22%2C%22AM%22%2C%22AO%22%2C%22AQ%22%2C%22AR%22%2C%22AS%22%2C%22AT%22%2C%22AU%22%2C%22AW%22%2C%22AX%22%2C%22AZ%22%2C%22BA%22%2C%22BB%22%2C%22BD%22%2C%22BE%22%2C%22BF%22%2C%22BG%22